Extract coarse relative operation hints in text order.

Returned entries are *hints* for TTC candidate generation, not a parse tree.
Each item is one of:
  - {"op": "+/-", "value": <delta>}
  - {"op": "*", "value": <factor>}
  - {"op": "/", "value": <divisor>}
  - {"op": "frac", "num": <n>, "den": <d>}
